<%- include('../partials/header') %><section class="page-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">FIVEM OPERATIONS</div><h1>Live Server & Patrol</h1><p>Connect your FiveM identity and view live Community Hub server operations.</p></div><a class="btn secondary" href="/fivem/status">Server status & uptime history</a></section><div class="stats"><% servers.forEach(s=>{ %><div><b><%= s.live?'ONLINE':'OFFLINE' %></b><span><%= s.name %> · <%= s.current_players %>/<%= s.max_players %></span></div><% }) %><div><b><%= patrol?'ON DUTY':'OFF DUTY' %></b><span><%= patrol?patrol.department_name||'Patrol':'No active patrol' %></span></div></div><div class="split"><section class="panel"><h2>FiveM Account</h2><% if(account.fivem_license){ %><p><strong>Linked:</strong> <%= account.fivem_name||'FiveM Player' %></p><p class="muted">Your game identity is connected to Community Hub.</p><% }else{ %><p>Your FiveM account has not been linked.</p><form method="post" action="/fivem/link-code"><button class="btn">Generate Linking Code</button></form><% } %></section><aside class="panel"><h2>In-Game Tablet</h2><p>Open the Community Hub operations tablet in FiveM with <strong>F6</strong> or <strong>/hub</strong>.</p><p class="muted">The tablet provides your profile, department, rank, certifications and patrol controls.</p></aside></div><%- include('../partials/footer') %>